## Model card

- **Name:** Space Bunny Alpha
- **Short description:** anonymous OpenRouter stealth-preview large model (released 2026-09-23) advertising fast inference, strong coding, native multimodal input, adjustable reasoning, and a 1M-token context; developer identity undisclosed — similar listing pattern to `stealth/ox-alpha` (later revealed as GLM-5.3 Flash).
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter `stealth/space-bunny-alpha` (Chat Completions `POST https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions`); OpenCode Zen catalog lists `opencode/space-bunny-alpha` (meta only); no open platform vendor page.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-23 (OpenRouter listing); knowledge cutoff not published (`null` on listing).
- **IDs:** `stealth/space-bunny-alpha` (OpenRouter); Zen catalog id `opencode/space-bunny-alpha`.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 input tokens; max output 524,288 tokens (OpenRouter `top_provider.max_completion_tokens`).
- **Modalities:** text/image/video in; text out; reasoning mandatory with efforts `max`/`xhigh`/`high`/`medium`/`low` (default `medium`); tools + `tool_choice` + JSON `response_format` supported (OpenRouter params).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-24):** prompt and completion both `0` — free during stealth preview (OpenRouter); post-preview price unknown; stealth terms: prompts/completions may be retained and used for training/evaluation — not for confidential data.
- **Architecture:** proprietary / unknown; no parameter count, tokenizer (filed as "Other"), license, or weights published.

